> I wanna know if exist any wiki about nethack...

This has been a curiously popular question recently, and a fortuitous
one too: Wikihack, at http://nethack.wikia.com is under active
development right now. I'm [[User:Jayt]].

Be warned: it (a) is far from complete, and (b) may contain errors.
That's the price you pay for a wiki, though (a) is becoming less of a
problem, and we're working hard on fixing (b).

Some interesting starting pages:

* The main page: http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Main_Page
* The history project: http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/History
* Tile gallery:
http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/List_of_vanilla_NetHack_tiles
* The interface gallery: http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Gui

And also curios such as:

http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/ASCII
http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Notable_ascensions
http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Movement_tactics
http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Deferred_features

If you want to contribute, please create an account
(http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Special:Userlogin) first. As the
standard welcome template says, "It helps us keep spam down, because we
don't have to check the edits of known-good users." The how to help
page (http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Wikihack:How_to_help) is a good
starting point.

